1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:14,230
256 levels. Tagged tv: 220 come out.

2
00:00:14,230 --> 00:00:23,970
17 columns black, 21 white.

3
00:00:23,970 --> 00:00:36,280
The tag. The pixels. A filter that guesses.

4
00:00:36,280 --> 00:00:45,510
Synthetic clips, ffmpeg 6.1.1 and 8.1.2.

5
00:00:45,510 --> 00:00:54,210
Raw bytes and signalstats agree.

6
00:00:54,210 --> 00:01:08,140
Control: 0 to 255 reads 0 to 255.

7
00:01:08,140 --> 00:01:22,060
setparams + -color_range pc: pc.

8
00:01:22,060 --> 00:01:35,980
Same bytes under every tag.

9
00:01:35,980 --> 00:01:47,950
Same bytes: tv 0..255, pc 16..235.

10
00:01:47,950 --> 00:02:01,920
Full ramp tagged tv: 220 of 256.

11
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:16,580
-color_range pc: 6.1.1 relabels.

12
00:02:16,580 --> 00:02:34,910
8.1.2 converts: 16..235 becomes 0..255.

13
00:02:34,910 --> 00:02:46,470
6.1.1: No such filter, exit 8.

14
00:02:46,470 --> 00:03:01,880
8.1.2: the verdict is only in the log.

15
00:03:01,880 --> 00:03:10,540
Outside 16..235 proves full range.

16
00:03:10,540 --> 00:03:26,140
One sample at 236, in 1 frame of 3.

17
00:03:26,140 --> 00:03:33,340
Ramp 0..255: JPEG / full range.

18
00:03:33,340 --> 00:03:40,550
Tagged tv or untagged: the same.

19
00:03:40,550 --> 00:03:47,290
16..235: undetermined.

20
00:03:47,290 --> 00:04:00,780
It never says limited.

21
00:04:00,780 --> 00:04:05,840
One sample at 236: full range.

22
00:04:05,840 --> 00:04:10,910
One sample at 15: full range.

23
00:04:10,910 --> 00:04:22,180
Cb 0..254, luma 16..235.

24
00:04:22,180 --> 00:04:27,810
colordetect: undetermined.

25
00:04:27,810 --> 00:04:40,430
Tagged pc, bytes 0..255: full.

26
00:04:40,430 --> 00:04:53,040
Tagged pc, bytes 56..204: undetermined.

27
00:04:53,040 --> 00:05:06,260
Opaque or straight: provable.

28
00:05:06,260 --> 00:05:12,870
Premultiplied-looking: undetermined.

29
00:05:12,870 --> 00:05:22,660
Same picture: rgba straight.

30
00:05:22,660 --> 00:05:27,560
yuva420p: undetermined.

31
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:38,490
Tag: ffprobe. Proof of full: signalstats.

32
00:05:38,490 --> 00:05:47,600
Limited can never be proven.

33
00:05:47,600 --> 00:05:55,500
ffprobe = tag. signalstats = pixels.

34
00:05:55,500 --> 00:06:02,080
colordetect proves full, never limited.

35
00:06:02,080 --> 00:06:13,950
Measured on 6.1.1 and 8.1.2, synthetic clips.

36
00:06:13,950 --> 00:06:25,830
Not tested: real footage, lossy codecs, players.
